        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox Nightly supports wasm type reflection.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Via collector test (which gets this data point via <a href=\"https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/wasm-feature-detect\">https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/wasm-feature-detect</a>).</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">More work is needed to address <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5319628521\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30393\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30393/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30393\">#30393</a>. The Collector doesn't update the recently added and more detailed WebAssembly compat data yet.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30815",
            "title": "Firefox Nightly supports wasm type reflection",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-09T10:37:04.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-09T10:36:29.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Elchi3",
                "url": "https://github.com/Elchi3"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126397667?u=3b8d9424f1a16860e2ee3c84887049f89cbaf37c&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">api.console.context_static</code> for the non-standard <code class=\"notranslate\">console.context()</code> method, so the new MDN page requested in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5746060804\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/46017/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017\">mdn/content#46017</a> has compat data.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Chrome 61: the method was added in V8 commit <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/701d79d08ad4/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/701d79d08ad4\">v8/v8@<tt>701d79d08ad4</tt></a> (June 2017), which is in V8 6.1 (<code class=\"notranslate\">6.1.534.32</code> contains it, <code class=\"notranslate\">6.0.286.52</code> does not). V8 6.1 shipped in Chrome 61. Confirmed present in Chrome 154.</li>\n<li>Firefox: not supported, <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1948870\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzil.la/1948870</a> is still open.</li>\n<li>Safari: not supported, <a href=\"https://webkit.org/b/293768\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/b/293768</a> is still open.</li>\n<li>Deno: <code class=\"notranslate\">typeof console.context</code> is <code class=\"notranslate\">\"undefined\"</code> in Deno 2.7.5 (tracking issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3108971415\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/29560\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/denoland/deno/issues/29560/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/29560\">denoland/deno#29560</a>).</li>\n<li>Node.js 8.7.0: first release with V8 6.1 (<code class=\"notranslate\">deps/v8/include/v8-version.h</code>), and its <code class=\"notranslate\">lib/internal/bootstrap_node.js</code> already copies V8-only console methods onto the Node.js console. Marked as partial because messages are only sent to an attached inspector (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2794011602\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/56634\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nodejs/node/issues/56634/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/56634\">nodejs/node#56634</a>). I confirmed that behavior in Node.js 22.14 using <code class=\"notranslate\">inspector.Session</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">Runtime.consoleAPICalled</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">npm run lint</code> passes apart from the expected 404 warning for the <code class=\"notranslate\">mdn_url</code>, which the mdn/content PR adds.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5746060804\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/46017/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017\">mdn/content#46017</a></p>",
